index ff49f33a..c36edbac 100644
--- a/docs/labs-mode.md
+++ b/docs/labs-mode.md
@@ -92,6 +92,16 @@ What formplayer sends to HQ for a labs request:
 * The CCZ comes from `/a/<domain>/apps/api/download_ccz/?app_id=<app_id>&latest=save`. That HQ
   endpoint is unauthenticated.
 
+## Workers on more than one HQ server
+
+`X-Labs-HQ-Host` (one of `LABS_HQ_HOSTS`) sends every HQ call for the request to that server. The
+same domain and username can exist on two servers (www and eu are separate databases), so a labs
+request for a server other than `COMMCARE_HOST` keeps its user's sandbox under
+`dbs/<domain>@<host>/<user>` (for example `dbs/my-domain@eu.commcarehq.org/worker1`) and its
+Redis sync-time key as `last-sync-time:<domain>@<host>:…`. A request for `COMMCARE_HOST` (header
+absent, or naming it) keeps upstream's `dbs/<domain>/<user>`. Send the same host on every request
+for a given worker.
+
 ## Per-request log line
 
 Every labs request (rejected ones included) writes one INFO line on the `labs.request` logger when
